{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785994710716846001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"runny-pip-lure","assignee":"Joe Oakhart","author":"Iso Tester","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":4},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1782826018697811001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[{"link_uuid":"950b87b0-df4a-446c-8799-f03a6af6e987","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"8855-e5f9-05b4-4a04"}],"description":"## Summary\nTwo related gaps in the workflow reference-linter (`workflow/lint_refs.py`), surfaced reviewing the code-review gate (epic b744 / WS3):\n1. `check_string` is routed over a step's `with:` values + the `if:` guard, but NOT over a `batch:` step's `criteria[].when` expressions (lint_refs.py ~378-407). So a typo'd `${{ steps.X.outputs.include_typo }}` in a batch criterion's `when:` is NEVER name-checked — it only surfaces at runtime.\n2. `_output_fields_map` (lint_refs.py ~547) reads only `schema.properties.keys()`, ignoring `patternProperties`. So an output whose dynamic keys live in `patternProperties` (e.g. `overlay_union_output`'s `include_<overlay>` keys, or `plan_review_assemble_criteria_output`'s `include_<ID>`) is invisible to the reference check.\n\n## Impact\nThe code-review gate (gates/code-review.yaml) leans on 22 `${{ steps.triggers/union.outputs.include_<overlay> }}` refs in batch `when:` clauses; none are linted. A typo would pass `rebar workflow validate` and only fail/misbehave at runtime (silently skipping an overlay). Pre-existing (plan-review's include_<ID> refs have the same blind spot); not introduced by b744.\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n1. In a v3 workflow, add a batch criterion `{prompt: X, when: '${{ steps.s.outputs.nonexistent_key }}'}`.\n2. `rebar workflow validate <file>` → passes (no 'output not produced' finding), despite the bogus ref.\nExpected: the linter flags the unknown output ref (as it does for `with:`/`if:`).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `lint_refs` walks `batch.criteria[].when` expressions through `check_string` (same as `if:`/`with:`).\n- [ ] `_output_fields_map` consults `patternProperties` (a ref matching a pattern is considered produced), so dynamic-keyed outputs aren't falsely flagged AND a non-matching typo IS flagged.\n- [ ] A test: a typo'd batch `when:` ref fails `workflow validate`; a valid `include_<overlay>` ref passes.\n\n## Notes\nDiscovered reviewing WS3 (8855) of the code-review epic (b744). Not fixed there (linter is shared infra; out of scope for the gate). Workaround: the code-review gate's offline test exercises the real `when:` resolution, catching typos at test time.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"45a22bca-1f49-4416-bc54-765ff0670d36","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f18b-a82a-5ba5-4ce3","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Workflow linter doesn't name-check batch.criteria[].when refs + is patternProperties-blind","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["bbeab37b-e81f-4d60-a86f-7cef8942e4e1","950b87b0-df4a-446c-8799-f03a6af6e987","45a22bca-1f49-4416-bc54-765ff0670d36","52ac6ee4-5263-4f21-bcd2-3a23afddb6a0"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785994710716846001,"uuid":"0192612b-d354-4809-a4e8-42ff34889288"}